								</span>
								<span>{isEnglish ? "We will respond within 24 hours" : "Atbildēsim uz Tavu pieteikumu 24 stundu laikā"}</span>
							</li>
							<li class="contact-section__benefit fade-in" data-reveal-delay="310">
								<span class="contact-section__check" aria-hidden="true">
									<img src="/check-mark.svg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="14" height="14" />
								</span>
								<span>{isEnglish ? "We handle your personal data with care." : "Mēs rūpējamies par Tavu datu drošību."}</span>
							</li>
						</ul>
					</div>

					<div class="contact-section__form-wrap">
						<div class="contact-section__card contact-form-card">
							<ContactForm
								client:load
								locale={locale}
								title={isEnglish ? "Leave your contact details" : "Atstāj savus kontaktus"}
								intro=""
								defaultInformation={isEnglish ? "I would like to book an apartment viewing." : "Vēlos pieteikties dzīvokļa apskatei."}
								submitLabel={isEnglish ? "Book a viewing" : "Pieteikties apskatei"}
							/>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>

